cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Dairy Data Tools: a dairy farm's DairyComp and EZfeed exports, read for consultants and their AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Agent skills and standard-library Python scripts that read a dairy farm's own DairyComp 305 and EZfeed exports:
  the DairyComp commands to export with, the herd and each pen and cow, pen cows joined to pen feed (intake, ECM per
  lb DM, feed cost per cwt, IOFC, NASEM predicted intake), a weekly or visit review, and a ration change with the
  season taken out. Read-only, no network.
authors:
